Package: isocountry
Title: ISO 3166-1 Country Codes and ISO 4217 Currency Codes
Version: 0.8.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Maximilian", "Mücke", , "muecke.maximilian@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-9432-9795"))
Description: ISO 3166-1 country codes combined with United Nations M49
    regional classifications and membership status in the OECD, the
    European Union (EU), the Economic and Monetary Union (EMU), and the
    European Economic Area (EEA), along with ISO 4217 currency codes for
    each country.
